"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Răspuns\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho = \\sum_i p_i |\\psi_i\\rangle\\langle\\psi_i|.\n"
"$$\n"
"$p_i \\neq 0$ only for the state $|\\Phi_+\\rangle$. So we can write\n"
